---
import SiteLayout from '@nyameko/ui/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Publications" siteName="Quantum Platform" section="User Portal"
  description="Verified research publications and scientific outputs using Quantum Platform.">
  <section class="section container public-research-directory">
    <p class="eyebrow">SCIENTIFIC OUTPUTS</p>
    <h1>Publications</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Discover peer-reviewed papers, preprints, theses and reproducible outputs
      that document the use of Quantum Platform infrastructure or software.
    </p>
    <div class="directory-actions">
      <a class="secondary-link" href="/how-to-cite/">How to cite Quantum Platform</a>
      <a class="secondary-link" href="https://github.com/nyameko/quantum-workflows">
        Scientific workflows and reproducible examples
      </a>
    </div>
    <section class="directory-empty" aria-labelledby="publications-heading">
      <h2 id="publications-heading">Verified research outputs</h2>
      <p>
        No publications have been independently verified for this directory yet.
        We will add publications only after checking their identifiers, source records,
        and evidence of actual platform use.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        ORCID, arXiv and DOI metadata discovery is planned; an external keyword match
        alone does not establish that a study used this platform.
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .public-research-directory { max-width: 65rem; padding-top: 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; margin: .4rem 0; }
  .directory-actions { display: flex; gap: .8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 1.6rem 0; }
  .secondary-link { padding: .7rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: .6rem; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }
  .directory-empty { background: var(--surface); padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: .9rem; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
</style>
